 808:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   Stack Pointer Limit register hence the write is silently ignored.
 809:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h **** 
 810:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Assigns the given value to the non-secure Main Stack Pointer Limit (MSPLIM) when in secu
 811:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \param [in]    MainStackPtrLimit  Main Stack Pointer value to set
 812:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****  */
